00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.720
Is there any, even in the multiplayer, which I'm sure we'll get to like eventually later,

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:56.940
but like it's all stuff that you could physically build.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:01.380
Well, well, nobody's, nobody's ever built a pinball machine that long.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:08.580
Yeah, no, this is, this is like, uh, if you had like, this is animation compared to live

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:09.480
action in a way.

00:04:09.660 --> 00:04:15.220
Like it, it is, it's not doing anything, uh, like super crazy.

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:21.440
Like having like mini games that completely change what pinball is.

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.360
Everything is very pinball forward.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:30.280
Um, but like, yeah, I think it's like twice the length of what a pinball machine could possibly

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:39.960
be. Uh, you've got, uh, you've got actual little like sub missions now that you, that you find

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.140
