00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.480
It's Pins, Pins Theorem.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:26.080
Pins Theorem? Yes.

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:27.460
Okay, now I know you're serious.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.240
You're right, Joe, you're right.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:31.540
