00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:44.320
Like, usually the size of a pinball screen would probably be like two of these screens, but

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:48.660
because now there's four screens in this game, you just would picture a machine that's twice

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:53.280
as long. Uh, I, I don't think it, there's anything stopping it from happening other than just

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:55.080
people being like, that's bar real estate.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.320
